MID_MV20_03: <SH>
MID_MV20_03_m001: (pained roar)
MID_MV20_03_m002: Raksha...where are you?
MID_MV20_03_m003: Fear not, Emperor Dagda. I am here.
MID_MV20_03_m004: Ah... There you are.
MID_MV20_03_m005: I stand ready...my emperor.
MID_MV20_03_m006: Precisely where I am most needed.
MID_MV20_03_m007: Heal my wounds...quickly...
MID_MV20_03_m008: Do this for me, Raksha.
MID_MV20_03_m009: (spell exert)
MID_MV20_03_m011: Treason! What are you playing at?!
MID_MV20_03_m012: The tendrils that ensnare you are forged\nof the souls gathered in the underworld.
MID_MV20_03_m013: They are quite unbreakable, even for you, Emperor.
MID_MV20_03_m014: Many souls died at your hand.\nNow they take their revenge.
MID_MV20_03_m015: Treacherous witch!
MID_MV20_03_m016: Raksha!
MID_MV20_03_m017: Since this is the last time you and I shall ever speak...
MID_MV20_03_m018: This is goodbye...Emperor.
MID_MV20_03_m019: You?!
MID_MV20_03_m020: Those eyes. You're Balor's...
MID_MV20_03_m021: I see... It was all a ruse...
MID_MV20_03_m022: Let me go... Release me!
MID_MV20_03_m023: (pained roar)
MID_MV20_03_m024: Millions of souls swallowed to\nbuild power...all for you.
MID_MV20_03_m025: Now you have consumed a Founder all soaked through\nin darkest sin. At long last, the hour has arrived.
MID_MV20_03_m026: Thus...I descend.